Common HRIS (Human Resource Information System) platforms include BambooHR, Rippling, Workday, SAP SuccessFactors, ADP Workforce Now, UKG, Gusto, HiBob, Paycor, and Zoho People. There is no standard HRIS software category or certification called "CPAT" ("cpat" usually refers to unrelated terms such as the Candidate Physical Ability Test for firefighters or CPaT Global aviation training software).

Popular HRIS Systems by Category

• Small & Midsize Businesses (SMB): BambooHR, Gusto, Zoho People, HiBob
• Mid-Market & Payroll-Focused: ADP Workforce Now, Paycor, Paylocity, Paycom
• Enterprise & All-in-One: Workday HCM, SAP SuccessFactors, Rippling, UKG
Did you mean a specific HR term or certification (such as SHRM-CP or PHR), or are you looking for HRIS options based on:
• Company size and headcount
• Location (such as India or US payroll compliance)
• Key features (payroll, leave/attendance, performance, or onboarding)
